[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 540.23, "timestamp": "00:09:00", "text": "我只是想画一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.87, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "等待的时候，我看到了许多可爱的小面孔。我喜欢这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.03, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "它一连接到我的平板电脑，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.31, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "它卡住了。哦，不错。哦，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 556.63, "timestamp": "00:09:16", "text": "太喜欢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 559.19, "timestamp": "00:09:19", "text": "是的，一眼就能看出我们是真正的 YouTuber。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 567.19, "timestamp": "00:09:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 570.949, "timestamp": "00:09:30", "text": "是的，我们伤痕累累。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 583.829, "timestamp": "00:09:43", "text": "你知道，到处都是该死的猫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 585.67, "timestamp": "00:09:45", "text": "我画的东西，我或许会变成一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 587.829, "timestamp": "00:09:47", "text": "成为一名兽人艺术家，开始赚钱。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 591.269, "timestamp": "00:09:51", "text": "感觉就像，你知道，我画了很多画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.71, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "猫。那纯粹是我的直觉。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 596.71, "timestamp": "00:09:56", "text": "绘画时的本能就是如此"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 598.092, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You can multiwatch the collab here - https://onxa.link/veomuZcl"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.34, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "画一只猫。"}]